# Catalogs API – REST Client
#
# Endpoints: /catalogs
# Purpose:
# - Menu collections that group categories with time-based availability.
# - A restaurant might have separate breakfast, lunch, and dinner catalogs,
#   each containing different category sets and active during different hours.
#
# Auth / cookies:
# - If your API uses Better Auth cookie sessions, keep @cookieJar consistent across files.
# - Origin protection: include Origin + Referer headers on protected routes.
#
# Usage flow:
# 1) Run Auth login in auth.http (stores cookie in jar)
# 2) Run requests here (cookie is reused via the same jar name)
#
# Notes:
# - Replace {{catalogId}} with a UUID from list/create responses.
# - If your API is mounted under /api, set @apiPrefix = /api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@cookieJar = betterauth

# If your server mounts routes under /api, set this to /api. Otherwise leave empty.
@apiPrefix = /api

# IDs (paste values from responses)
@catalogId = 9bd6fa53-8293-4891-8271-f3cef3030199


### List all catalogs - OK
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalogs
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Retrieve a catalog by id - OK
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalogs/{{catalogId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

//TODO: flaten the response
### Retrieve a catalog with its categories - OK
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalogs/{{catalogId}}/categories
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

//TODO: flaten the response
### ??? Retrieve a catalog with full menu tree (detailed)
# Returns catalog with categories, products, modifier groups, modifiers, and dependencies
# Designed for POS menu rendering
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalogs/{{catalogId}}/detailed
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/


### Create a catalog - OK
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalogs
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{  
  "name": "Second Menu",
  "description": "Second menu",
  "internalNotes": "Oti nanai",
  "displayOrder": 2,
  "availableFrom": null,
  "availableUntil": null,
  "activeDaysOfWeek": [0,2,4],
  "color": "#ff0000",
  "image": null,
  "isActive": true
}

# {
#   "name": "Main Menu",
#   "description": "Main menu",
#   "isActive": true,
#   "startTime": null,
#   "endTime": null
# }

# {
#   "name": "Lunch Menu2",
#   "description": "Lunch menu available 11am-4pm",
#   "isActive": true,
#   "startTime": "11:00:00",
#   "endTime": "16:00:00"
# }


### Patch/update a catalog (only include fields you want to change) - OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalogs/{{catalogId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "Breakfast Menu - Updated",
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete a catalog - OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalogs/{{catalogId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/
